    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Line element mesher: collection of functions.</para>
<para>Creates polyline meshes that of an arbitrary dimension (like a spiral in 3D space). The meshes can contain duplicated nodes and INTERNAL boundaries.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>Mesher does not assign <ref refid="group___c_s_m_pglobal_enums_1ga8e4421c3cd02f67e535bceb2dc74bfb6" kindref="member">BOX_BOUNDARY</ref> flags nor neighbor connectivity</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="author"><para>Stephan Matthai </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="author"><para>extended to work with mulit-dimensional models by Roman Manasipov </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2002, 2012</para>
</simplesect>
<xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000053"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>ADD BOUNDARY FLAGS, <ref refid="group___c_s_m_p__global__enumerations_1ga65b4b9788928fc2599d5cc1d1960942a" kindref="member">TOPOTYPE</ref>, AND MATERIAL IDENTIFIERS TO VSET! </para>
<para>create <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_node_manifold" kindref="compound">NodeManifold</ref> objects in case of a split boundary </para>
<para>create <ref refid="group___c_s_m_pglobal_enums_1ga8e4421c3cd02f67e535bceb2dc74bfb6" kindref="member">BOX_BOUNDARY</ref> flags </para>
<para>create neighbor connectivity </para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
    </detaileddescription>
